# Dockerfile Patch Instructions

Add to the existing OpenClaw Dockerfile (ghcr.io/laxcorp/openclaw-runtime):

After the line that installs openclaw extensions, add:

    COPY process-manager.mjs /usr/local/bin/process-manager.mjs
    COPY credit-proxy.mjs /usr/local/bin/credit-proxy.mjs

Replace the existing CMD/ENTRYPOINT with:

    CMD ["node", "/usr/local/bin/process-manager.mjs"]

The process-manager handles starting the OpenClaw gateway internally,
so the original CMD (node openclaw.mjs gateway --bind lan --port 18789)
is no longer needed as the explicit entrypoint.

Note: The Railway boot script (CLAWS_BOOT_B64) has been updated to
detect /usr/local/bin/process-manager.mjs and use it when present,
falling back to direct gateway launch for old images without it.
